  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 525.05 Restoration/Enhancement Activities Construction Project Classification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 525.05 Restoration/Enhancement Activities Construction Project Classification. A restoration/enhancement project shall be a minimum impact project if the project:\n\n(a) Is not proposed to be used to fulfill the requirements of an administrative order, court order, settlement, or other enforcement proceeding obligating the applicant or another person to perform such restoration/enhancement activities; and\n\n(b) Meets the requirements for a project-type exception specified in Env-Wt 407.04(b).\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
}
